1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:45,461 --> 00:01:53,941
Twenty-Second Episode
A New King
The Coronation

15
00:02:20,170 --> 00:02:22,560
If I put my mind to it, I can do it too.

16
00:02:22,904 --> 00:02:25,160
Until now, I've been weak and cowardly.

17
00:02:26,274 --> 00:02:29,080
Alright, I have courage too!

18
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:32,580
Dr. Uranari, tonight is the night—I have made up my mind.

19
00:02:32,924 --> 00:02:35,800
Tomorrow, I will make an announcement that will shock everyone.

20
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:40,580
Doctor, look forward to tomorrow.

21
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:44,800
But Your Majesty, that... what on earth is this?

22
00:02:45,214 --> 00:02:46,214
It's a secret.

23
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:49,500
So, Doctor, please leave me alone.

24
00:02:50,303 --> 00:02:51,693
Well then...

25
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:16,582
"As of today, I am changing the law of Silverland"

26
00:03:16,606 --> 00:03:18,740
"that forbids women from taking the throne."

27
00:03:19,026 --> 00:03:21,382
"In the name of the King, I hereby decree"

28
00:03:21,406 --> 00:03:23,966
"that a woman may become Queen and rule this land."

29
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:30,653
There we go.
<i>Patched Gourd</i>

30
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:32,740
Ah, perfect.

31
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:35,880
Starting with this, I will change all the bad laws one after another.

32
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,113
I can't take much more of this...

33
00:03:49,610 --> 00:03:50,610
What are you doing?

34
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,800
What are you saying?

35
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:06,880
Your Highness!

36
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
Your Highness!

37
00:04:08,064 --> 00:04:09,400
This is terrible!

38
00:04:09,964 --> 00:04:11,959
The King is missing!

39
00:04:12,047 --> 00:04:12,761
What?!

40
00:04:12,785 --> 00:04:16,179
He hasn't been seen anywhere since this morning.

41
00:04:16,820 --> 00:04:17,820
Where is Mother?

42
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,613
Where is everyone?

43
00:04:18,670 --> 00:04:20,420
They're frantically searching everywhere.

44
00:04:20,975 --> 00:04:23,748
Your Majesty!

45
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,306
Your Majesty!

46
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,873
Your Majesty!

47
00:04:28,980 --> 00:04:31,313
Your Majesty!

48
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:35,986
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

49
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:39,720
Search every nook and cranny again—once, twice, three times!

50
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:41,016
Thoroughly, search thoroughly!

51
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:42,456
Your Majesty!

52
00:04:43,730 --> 00:04:45,589
Father!

53
00:04:45,614 --> 00:04:46,620
Your Majesty!

54
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,960
Your Majesty!

55
00:04:48,465 --> 00:04:49,924
Your Majesty!

56
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:51,340
Your Highness!

57
00:04:51,455 --> 00:04:54,686
We searched the castle from top to bottom, but he's nowhere to be found.

58
00:04:54,725 --> 00:04:56,120
Check inside the moat, too!

59
00:04:56,210 --> 00:04:57,583
Right away!

60
00:05:00,660 --> 00:05:04,900
My Queen, the King was up writing something alone all night.

61
00:05:05,145 --> 00:05:07,353
Oh, if something happened to him...

62
00:05:07,501 --> 00:05:09,501
I'll go search again!

63
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,020
The family must be so worried.

64
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:18,200
Still, for the King to just vanish is truly bizarre.

65
00:05:18,325 --> 00:05:19,720
Keep your mouth shut!

66
00:05:19,905 --> 00:05:21,460
We shall search as well.

67
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,286
Command us as you will.

68
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:27,413
Father!

69
00:05:28,141 --> 00:05:31,534
Father!

70
00:05:32,327 --> 00:05:34,327
Where are you?!

71
00:05:34,657 --> 00:05:37,104
Father!

72
00:05:40,467 --> 00:05:41,480
He's not in here, either.

73
00:05:41,805 --> 00:05:43,040
Ah, the armor!

74
00:05:45,516 --> 00:05:49,010
Father!

75
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,179
Father!

76
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:57,140
Even in the ancestral tombs... but...

77
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:04,199
Father!

78
00:06:07,003 --> 00:06:09,876
Father!

79
00:06:10,343 --> 00:06:12,736
Father!

80
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,260
I heard something!

81
00:06:19,933 --> 00:06:21,166
Father!

82
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:22,940
Was it just my imagination?

83
00:06:24,330 --> 00:06:28,480
My Prince, someone spotted a figure resembling the King early this morning.

84
00:06:30,003 --> 00:06:30,869
Where?

85
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:32,960
Over by the northern valley.

86
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:35,400
Alright, I'll go check!

87
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,820
Opal, head to the northern valley!

88
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:17,413
Father!

89
00:07:18,856 --> 00:07:19,440
Opal.

90
00:07:19,464 --> 00:07:20,190
What's wrong?

91
00:07:20,660 --> 00:07:21,220
What is it?

92
00:07:26,230 --> 00:07:27,700
It looks like Father's shoe.

93
00:07:27,965 --> 00:07:30,060
Opal, hold the end of this rope in your mouth.

94
00:07:30,170 --> 00:07:31,170
I'm going down.

95
00:07:52,410 --> 00:07:53,703
What's wrong?

96
00:07:56,314 --> 00:07:57,741
OPAL!

97
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:26,653
It's Father's shoe!

98
00:08:33,239 --> 00:08:35,106
Oh, my darling!

99
00:08:42,549 --> 00:08:45,100
My deepest condolences.

100
00:08:46,493 --> 00:08:47,346
Mother!

101
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,740
Father?!

102
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,813
What happened?

103
00:09:32,249 --> 00:09:32,983
Your Grace,

104
00:09:33,007 --> 00:09:38,120
one week after the King's passing, the Prince will succeed to the throne.

105
00:09:38,345 --> 00:09:40,580
Prince Sapphire's coronation, is it?

106
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:43,343
If our scheme goes smoothly by then...

107
00:09:43,367 --> 00:09:45,820
it should be quite an interesting coronation!

108
00:09:47,499 --> 00:09:49,046
You fool, Nylon!

109
00:10:18,669 --> 00:10:20,180
Sapphire, it's me.

110
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,660
Come in, Mother.

111
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:24,580
Mother.

112
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:25,960
How do I look?

113
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,640
You look beautiful, Sapphire.

114
00:10:29,490 --> 00:10:31,180
You thought I was crying, didn't you?

115
00:10:31,405 --> 00:10:33,500
Yes, I came to comfort you.

116
00:10:34,395 --> 00:10:35,920
I'm not going to cry anymore.

117
00:10:36,485 --> 00:10:37,980
Instead of crying, I decided to dress up.

118
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:39,620
But why?

119
00:10:41,139 --> 00:10:43,240
It's the last time I'll ever get to dress up.

120
00:10:44,899 --> 00:10:48,460
Once I become King, I'll never be able to wear clothes like this again.

121
00:10:48,795 --> 00:10:50,883
So you decided to wear them one last time.

122
00:10:50,907 --> 00:10:51,788
That's right.

123
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,200
Nanny, were you there?

124
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:58,986
Yes, I was helping her get dressed.

125
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,660
Don't cry.

126
00:11:00,845 --> 00:11:01,933
Come on, smile.

127
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,380
How could I not cry?

128
00:11:04,980 --> 00:11:08,053
Sapphire, this will certainly not be the last time you dress up.

129
00:11:08,545 --> 00:11:12,520
Once you ascend to the throne, you can change those old laws right away.

130
00:11:12,919 --> 00:11:14,140
So that anyone can become King.

131
00:11:14,395 --> 00:11:17,100
Take a new step so a woman can become queen.

132
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:18,193
That's true.

133
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:19,960
Mother, that's what I'll do!

134
00:11:20,389 --> 00:11:21,389
I'll definitely do it.

135
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,040
I won't back down!

136
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,600
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

137
00:11:25,259 --> 00:11:26,560
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

138
00:11:27,165 --> 00:11:30,959
♪ Ureshi ureshi dai kanki ♪
I'm so happy! I'm overjoyed!

139
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:33,119
♪ Lu lu lu, lu lu lu ♪
-

140
00:11:33,246 --> 00:11:36,680
♪ Ureshi dai kanki ♪
Oh, happy, great joy!

141
00:11:37,303 --> 00:11:39,553
♪ O shiro pikapikapi ♪
The castle is sparkling bright!

142
00:11:48,509 --> 00:11:49,980
♪ Pikapika ♪
Sparkling bright!

143
00:11:50,545 --> 00:11:52,146
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

144
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:53,900
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

145
00:11:54,495 --> 00:11:58,086
♪ Ureshi ureshi dai kanki ♪
I'm so happy! I'm overjoyed!

146
00:11:58,413 --> 00:12:01,633
♪ Lu lu lu, lu lu lu, lu lu lu ♪
-

147
00:12:02,073 --> 00:12:05,480
♪ Kireina dai kanki ♪
Beautiful, great joy!

148
00:12:06,133 --> 00:12:11,833
♪ Dare mo tsuya tsuya tsuya tsuya ♪
Everyone is glowing and bright!

149
00:12:15,869 --> 00:12:21,386
♪ Tsuya tsuya dai kanki ♪
Glowing, great joy!

150
00:12:25,929 --> 00:12:26,720
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

151
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:27,920
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

152
00:12:27,966 --> 00:12:29,574
♪ La la, la la, la la la ♪
-

153
00:12:29,739 --> 00:12:33,279
♪ Docchi so mo docchi so mo onaka ga pekopeko ♪
One and all, our tummies are rumbling!

154
00:12:33,538 --> 00:12:37,173
♪ Okashi mo pakupaku pakupaku pakupaku ♪
Munching away on treats!

155
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:39,472
♪ Oishi gochiso ♪
A delicious feast!

156
00:12:39,500 --> 00:12:40,996
♪ La la lan, la la la la ♪
-

157
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:42,426
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

158
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,466
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

159
00:12:43,580 --> 00:12:47,500
♪ Kazaro kazaro omatsuri omatsuri ♪
Decorate, decorate for the grand festival!

160
00:12:47,525 --> 00:12:49,406
♪ La la, lan lan, lu lu lu ♪
-

161
00:12:49,430 --> 00:12:51,440
♪ Kazaro kazaro ♪
Decorate, decorate!

162
00:12:51,486 --> 00:12:52,956
♪ La la, la la, la la la ♪
-

163
00:12:52,980 --> 00:12:55,443
♪ Besu wa fu fu ♪
The bass goes puff-puff!

164
00:12:55,467 --> 00:12:57,213
♪ Fu fu fu fu fu fu ♪
puff puff puff puff puff puff!

165
00:12:57,265 --> 00:12:58,999
♪ Rappa wa fu fu ♪
The horn goes puff-puff!

166
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:03,520
♪ La la la, la la la la ♪
-

167
00:13:03,544 --> 00:13:06,117
♪ La la, la la la la ♪
-

168
00:13:06,146 --> 00:13:08,097
♪ La la la lo ♪
-

169
00:13:08,121 --> 00:13:09,660
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

170
00:13:10,239 --> 00:13:11,620
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

171
00:13:12,071 --> 00:13:15,706
♪ Okyaku ya okyaku no dai kanki ♪
Welcome, guests! Such great joy!

172
00:13:15,766 --> 00:13:17,556
♪ Lu lu lu, lu lu lu ♪
-

173
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:21,980
♪ O uma wa pa pa pa pa kuruma mo pon pon pon pon ♪
Horses clip-clopping, carriages chugging along!

174
00:13:22,060 --> 00:13:35,540
♪ Yokoso yokoso ureshi ureshi dai kanki ♪
Welcome, welcome! We're so happy, what great joy!

175
00:13:39,481 --> 00:13:41,413
The Great Jubilee is finally tomorrow.

176
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,738
Preparations at the castle are nearly complete,

177
00:13:43,762 --> 00:13:46,220
 and delegates from around the world are arriving one after another.

178
00:13:52,249 --> 00:13:54,812
Ahead of this major ceremony, Prince Sapphire

179
00:13:54,836 --> 00:13:57,440
is surely resting calmly, awaiting the dawn.

180
00:13:58,099 --> 00:14:01,300
Dear God, please grant me courage and strength.

181
00:14:02,075 --> 00:14:03,240
I'm scared.

182
00:14:03,845 --> 00:14:05,680
I'm so terrified of living a lie.

183
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:07,180
Dawn is already here.

184
00:14:07,545 --> 00:14:09,353
Dear God, please protect me.

185
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:22,700
Apothecary Ponko, is that poison ready yet?

186
00:14:22,845 --> 00:14:25,180
Hehehehehe, it's almost done.

187
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:26,320
Just three more hours.

188
00:14:26,469 --> 00:14:28,040
Hurry up, work faster!

189
00:14:28,145 --> 00:14:29,619
We won't make it in time for the Jubilee!

190
00:14:29,765 --> 00:14:32,800
It'll be ready, it'll be ready! Plenty of time before the ceremony.

191
00:14:33,940 --> 00:14:34,861
How effective is it?

192
00:14:35,289 --> 00:14:39,603
One sip and they'll blab whatever's on their mind. It's plenty potent.

193
00:14:39,627 --> 00:14:42,553
If it isn't ready in time, I'll chop off your head!

194
00:14:43,475 --> 00:14:45,380
I'll wait right here until it's finished.

195
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:47,946
Hurry up and make it.

196
00:14:49,770 --> 00:14:50,315
Move it!

197
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:52,320
So violent.

198
00:14:54,279 --> 00:14:55,680
I'm thirsty. Got any booze?

199
00:14:56,129 --> 00:14:57,129
On the shelf.

200
00:14:57,275 --> 00:14:58,275
This is it.

201
00:15:03,615 --> 00:15:05,560
Ponko, what kind of booze is this?

202
00:15:06,673 --> 00:15:08,213
You grabbed the wrong one, Mr. Nylon.

203
00:15:08,238 --> 00:15:09,474
That's not booze.

204
00:15:09,499 --> 00:15:10,499
That's a weight-gain potion.

205
00:15:10,999 --> 00:15:11,999
A weight-gain potion?!

206
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:15,873
Do something! Give me a cure!

207
00:15:16,139 --> 00:15:17,779
There's no quick cure for that.

208
00:15:17,811 --> 00:15:19,606
You'll stay like that until it wears off.

209
00:15:20,060 --> 00:15:22,100
Anything will do! A weight-loss potion!

210
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:23,900
Here.

211
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:33,660
What is it, Ponko?

212
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,200
Don't you worry.

213
00:15:35,395 --> 00:15:37,500
You'll be back to normal by the time the potion is ready.

214
00:15:38,030 --> 00:15:40,560
Until then, why don't you take a nice little nap?

215
00:16:08,949 --> 00:16:13,059
We will now begin Prince Sapphire's grand coronation!

216
00:16:19,569 --> 00:16:21,100
I hope everything goes smoothly...

217
00:16:26,269 --> 00:16:28,640
The grand coronation ceremony is about to begin.

218
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,040
Representatives from around the world, dressed in fine attire,

219
00:16:32,064 --> 00:16:35,060
eagerly await the Prince's arrival with bated breath.

220
00:16:35,305 --> 00:16:39,700
Once Prince Sapphire takes this throne, Silverland will welcome its new king.

221
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:42,380
Grand Duke Duralumin!

222
00:16:46,609 --> 00:16:48,426
Daddy, I want something to eat.

223
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:51,540
Shh! Be patient, there will be a feast later.

224
00:16:55,029 --> 00:16:56,480
You fool, stop that!

225
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:57,940
Here, I'll give you some candy.

226
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:03,273
Presenting Her Majesty the Queen!

227
00:17:06,336 --> 00:17:08,986
<i>Sapphire, I pray the ceremony goes smoothly.</i>

228
00:17:09,444 --> 00:17:11,026
Where on earth is Nylon?

229
00:17:11,299 --> 00:17:12,940
He hasn't shown up at the hall yet.

230
00:17:13,079 --> 00:17:14,440
What is he doing?

231
00:17:15,739 --> 00:17:19,060
Presenting His Highness Prince Sapphire and His Grace the Archbishop!

232
00:17:33,114 --> 00:17:36,040
Accompanied by the choir, the Prince finally makes his entrance!

233
00:18:03,536 --> 00:18:06,180
Next, we shall proceed with the crowning ceremony.

234
00:18:11,514 --> 00:18:14,600
Look, it has over a hundred diamonds on it!

235
00:18:15,019 --> 00:18:18,559
You fool, it has at least two hundred!

236
00:19:09,069 --> 00:19:10,706
Your Grace, Nylon has returned.

237
00:19:10,885 --> 00:19:11,885
She's back!

238
00:19:12,090 --> 00:19:12,840
I'll make it!

239
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:14,960
Tell him to hurry up and mix the drug into the wine!

240
00:19:21,389 --> 00:19:25,620
The Grand Duke ordered us to mix the potion into the Queen's wine right away.

241
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:26,740
Give me the medicine!

242
00:19:26,933 --> 00:19:27,340
What?

243
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:27,900
No!

244
00:19:28,185 --> 00:19:29,185
Why not?!

245
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,880
I'm the one who got the medicine!

246
00:19:31,079 --> 00:19:33,260
I should put it in the Queen's glass myself!

247
00:19:34,145 --> 00:19:35,145
Enough already!

248
00:19:35,244 --> 00:19:36,400
You go rest!

249
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,420
I'll do it!

250
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,700
I said <i>I'll</i> do it!

251
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:39,800
Get lost!

252
00:19:40,139 --> 00:19:41,666
Just go take a rest!

253
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:42,920
I won't!

254
00:19:43,129 --> 00:19:46,706
Now then, we shall proceed to the toast.

255
00:19:46,954 --> 00:19:49,320
Everyone, I will now pour the celebratory wine.

256
00:19:49,584 --> 00:19:51,673
Once poured, please do not drink until instructed.

257
00:19:52,019 --> 00:19:55,473
Grand Duke Duralumin, please lead the toast.

258
00:19:57,335 --> 00:19:59,480
Hold on. Is that glass for the Queen?

259
00:19:59,580 --> 00:19:59,980
That's right.

260
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:01,573
Sounds good. Alright.

261
00:20:10,669 --> 00:20:11,880
Now it's as good as ours!

262
00:20:37,179 --> 00:20:41,080
Now, a toast to King Sapphire and Silverland.

263
00:20:41,555 --> 00:20:42,555
Cheers!

264
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:44,340
Cheers!

265
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:45,460
Cheers!

266
00:20:51,029 --> 00:20:52,380
<i>Grand Duke Duralumin!</i>

267
00:20:52,582 --> 00:20:53,075
<i>Wait!</i>

268
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:54,240
Cheers!

269
00:20:54,241 --> 00:20:55,241
Ah!

270
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:00,080
Mother!

271
00:21:02,889 --> 00:21:04,860
Someone, take Mother to her room!

272
00:21:06,789 --> 00:21:08,760
It's all right now, it's all right.

273
00:21:08,969 --> 00:21:12,933
I never knew keeping this secret alone would be so painful.

274
00:21:13,080 --> 00:21:13,460
Mother!

275
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:16,360
Now is the time to reveal everything.

276
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:20,840
What do you mean?

277
00:21:23,079 --> 00:21:27,173
Sapphire... my child Sapphire is actually a girl.

278
00:21:28,340 --> 00:21:29,340
What?

279
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:30,040
Yes.

280
00:21:30,249 --> 00:21:31,800
Sapphire is a girl.

281
00:21:32,054 --> 00:21:35,580
To put her on the throne, they forced her to pose as a boy!

282
00:21:46,494 --> 00:21:48,347
Did you all hear that?!

283
00:21:48,372 --> 00:21:50,005
Everyone, that is a direct confession!

284
00:21:50,029 --> 00:21:54,800
For 13 years, this mother and child lied and deceived the nation!

285
00:21:55,115 --> 00:21:55,900
They're traitors!

286
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:57,653
Cowards who deceived the people!

287
00:21:57,959 --> 00:22:00,280
U-Um... did I say something wrong?

288
00:22:00,414 --> 00:22:02,360
Mother, it's too late!

289
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:02,793
What?

290
00:22:03,364 --> 00:22:04,440
That's right, it's too late!

291
00:22:04,504 --> 00:22:06,220
You've confessed to everything!

292
00:22:06,480 --> 00:22:07,133
Guards!

293
00:22:07,239 --> 00:22:09,320
Arrest these traitors!

294
00:22:09,479 --> 00:22:12,613
And seize those three henchmen of theirs, too!

295
00:22:18,499 --> 00:22:19,980
This is punishment for deceiving the people!

296
00:22:20,084 --> 00:22:23,766
Prince Sapphire and the Queen shall be locked in the Coffin Tower for life!

297
00:22:23,924 --> 00:22:25,540
Surely no one objects!

298
00:22:25,625 --> 00:22:26,625
The Coffin Tower?

299
00:22:26,745 --> 00:22:27,745
For life?

300
00:22:28,119 --> 00:22:32,179
As for those three, for aiding traitors, they'll be slaves in the quarry!

301
00:22:32,460 --> 00:22:34,126
Slaves in the quarry?!

302
00:22:34,494 --> 00:22:38,533
And on the new throne, my son Plastic shall sit!

303
00:22:43,620 --> 00:22:47,860
No one objects to King Plastic, I presume!

304
00:22:53,479 --> 00:22:56,259
Drag the criminals away!

305
00:22:56,819 --> 00:22:59,023
Now then, Prince Sapphire—or rather, Princess Sapphire—

306
00:22:59,047 --> 00:23:02,780
and Her Majesty, I am afraid you must step into the prison carriage.

307
00:23:08,473 --> 00:23:10,020
Mother, let's go.

308
00:23:12,879 --> 00:23:14,600
Sapphire, forgive me.

309
00:23:15,664 --> 00:23:18,400
Mother we fell right into Duralumin's trap!

310
00:23:18,814 --> 00:23:20,540
He must've been made to drink poisoned wine.

311
00:23:21,235 --> 00:23:23,120
We won't be seeing each other again.

312
00:23:25,064 --> 00:23:26,419
Farewell, then.

313
00:24:12,309 --> 00:24:14,160
That over there is the Coffin Tower.

314
00:24:14,633 --> 00:24:20,760
I pity you, Princess Sapphire, but once you go in there, you'll never leave until you're nothing but bones.

315
00:24:21,175 --> 00:24:22,175
Prepare yourself!

